e a pigeon in order to move around and interact with your world\n\u2022 Unlock and discover four different levels\n\u2022 Protect your bread from other pigeons\n\u2022 Use power-ups and map shortcuts to be faster than\nother pigeons\n\u2022 Your pigeon enemies come in different shapes, avoid\nunnecessary conflicts!", "short_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop,\nAnd all the men and women merely pigeons.  \nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement\ncontrols to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the\ngranny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Maestro Pivetta", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrkiwi.org/what-vr/eula-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRKiwi (Mekiwi)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrkiwi.org/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "308977607939024"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031315_1000314747114205_6157251180126451813_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tJMUygS7_CQQ7kNvwEadoz6&_nc_oc=AdriZ2K0QObwX2upUa2eHUpNDH3M0Yn5fLFJ0oEU1w4LsJkpXvby6mMlp6c-o2mDp1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkID1YuYnM0b5o0qt5faCtVsv58qETE0qcM-1MJR22mQ&oe=6A98588D"}, "is_concept": false